```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph UI ["Desktop UI (React + Tailwind + shadcn/ui)"]
        CS[Cluster Switcher / Env Color]
        RO[Read-Only Safeguard]
        CP[Command Palette Cmd+K]
        PT[Live Pod Table TanStack]
        DF[Dry-Run Diff Modal]
        TX[xterm.js Terminal]
        PF[Port Forward Manager]
        AI_UI[AI Copilot Drawer]
    end

    subgraph Core ["Rust App Core (Tauri IPC)"]
        CB[Credential Broker / Keyring]
        SS[Session State & Env Tagging]
        AL[Tamper-Evident Audit Log]
        RE[Secret Redaction Engine]
        AI_ENG[AI Safety & Whitelist Engine]
    end

    subgraph Connectors ["Connector Layer (ClusterConnector Trait)"]
        LC[LocalConnector kubeconfig]
        EC[EksConnector aws-sdk-sts]
        AC[AksConnector azure_identity]
    end

    subgraph Clusters ["Kubernetes API Servers"]
        K1[Local Kind / Minikube]
        K2[AWS EKS API Server]
        K3[Azure AKS API Server]
    end

    subgraph AIProviders ["LLM Providers"]
        ANT[Anthropic Claude API]
        OAI[OpenAI API]
        OLL[Local Ollama / Llama.cpp]
    end

    UI <-->|Tauri IPC / Scoped Events| Core
    Core --> Connectors
    LC -->|Direct TLS| K1
    EC -->|Short-lived STS Token| K2
    AC -->|Short-lived AAD Token| K3

    AI_UI <--> AI_ENG
    AI_ENG --> AIProviders
    AI_ENG -->|Mutations Require Diff Approval| DF
```
